  "blocks": [
    {
      "ref": "p0269#1",
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**101. 质能联系**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0269#2",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在我们来谈谈相对论在核物理学和基本粒子物理学中",
        "起最重要作用的一个成果. 这就是**能量与质量之间的普遍联**",
        "**系问题**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0269#3",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "质能关系必然地是从能量守恒定律中得出的，也是从物",
        "体质量取决于物体运动速度这一事实中得出的. 这一点可以",
        "在简单的例子上看出来. 加热容器中的气体时，使气体获得了",
        "一定的能；分子的无规则的热运动的速度与温度有关，且随着",
        "气体的加热而增大. 根据公式(8.9)分子运动速度的增大就",
        "意味着所有分子质量增加. 由此可见，容器中气体的质量在气",
        "体的内能增加时也增加了. 在气体质量和它的能量之间存在",
        "着联系."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0269#4",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**低速运动时的质能关系** 以大大小于光速$c$的速度$v$运",
        "动的物体为例来确定质能的定量关系，是再简单不过的了. 为",
        "此我们来求出，当$v\\ll c$时，质量对速度的依赖关系的近似表",
        "示式. 公式(8.9)中的分母可以这样写出：",
        "$\\sqrt{1-\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}=\\sqrt{\\left(1-\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{v^2}{c^2}\\right)^2-\\frac{1}{4}\\frac{v^4}{c^4}}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0269#5",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把微小量$\\frac{1}{4}\\frac{v^4}{c^4}$忽略不计，可得：",
        "$\\sqrt{1-\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}\\approx 1-\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{v^2}{c^2}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0269#6",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所以",
        "$m\\approx\\frac{m_0}{1-\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0270#1",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把分子和分母都乘以$\\left(1+\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{v^2}{c^2}\\right)$，再把项$\\frac{1}{4}\\frac{v^4}{c^4}$忽略不计，",
        "就可得近似公式",
        "$m\\approx m_0+\\frac{1}{2}m_0v^2\\frac{1}{c^2}$　(8.11)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0270#2",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此可见，在物体的动能增加",
        "$\\Delta K=\\frac{1}{2}m_0v^2$",
        "时，它的质量的变化$\\Delta m=m-m_0$可表示为",
        "$\\Delta m=\\frac{\\Delta K}{c^2}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0270#3",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这就是说，**物体质量在物体速度增大时的增加量等于给予物**",
        "**体的动能除以光速的平方.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0270#4",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**爱因斯坦公式** 在相对论中，这个结论概括性很强. 爱因",
        "斯坦利用这个理论确定了能量和质量之间的极其简洁概括的",
        "公式：",
        "$E=mc^2=\\frac{m_0c^2}{\\sqrt{1-\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}}$　(8.12)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0270#5",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "***物体或物体系的能量等于其质量乘以光速的平方.*** 在整",
        "个物理学中只能找到两三个这样简洁而又普遍的与有重大价",
        "值的物理量有关的公式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0270#6",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果系统的能量改变了，则它的质量也要改变：",
        "$\\Delta m=\\frac{\\Delta E}{c^2}$　(8.13)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0270#7",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为系数$\\frac{1}{c^2}$非常小，所以质量的明显的变化只是在能量",
        "有非常大的变化时才是可能的. 在通常的条件下在化学反应"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0271#1",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "中，或在加热物体时，能量的改变是如此之小，以至不能在实",
        "验中发现质量的改变. 滚烫的茶壶的质量比冷茶壶的质量大",
        "些，但就是利用最灵敏的天平，这个质量差也反映不出来. 只",
        "有在原子核和基本粒子的变化中，能量的变化才大到使质量",
        "的变化能觉察出来."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0271#2",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在氢弹爆炸时放出巨大的能量——将近$10^{17}$焦耳. 这个",
        "能量超过了整个地球上几天之内产生的电能. 释放出来的能",
        "和辐射一起传播. 辐射具有能量，同时也具有质量，此质量近",
        "似为原有物质质量的$0.1\\%$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0271#3",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**静能** 在物体低速($v\\ll c$)运动的时候，公式(8.12)可以",
        "表示如下①：",
        "$E\\approx m_0c^2+\\frac{mv^2}{2}$　(8.14)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0271#4",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这里第二项是物体的一般动能. 最大的趣味和新颖之点",
        "在于第一项. 这第一项确定速度为0时物体的能量，即所谓",
        "的**静能**$E_0$；",
        "$E_0=m_0c^2$　(8.15)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0271#5",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这是一个卓越的成果. **仅仅由于物体本身的存在，任何一**",
        "**个物体就具有能量，而这能量的大小与静质量$m_0$成正比.** 最",
        "明显的证明静能存在的实验是，当具有静止质量的基本粒子",
        "转变为$m_0=0$的粒子时，静能就完全转变为重新组合成的粒",
        "子的动能."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0271#6",
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**问题**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0271#7",
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 写出表示物体质量与物体运动速度的关系式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0271#8",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": "footnote",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "① 在这种情况下我们利用质量的近似表达式(8.11)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0272#1",
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 质能关系定律的内容是什么？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0272#2",
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3. 什么是静能？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0272#3",
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4. 为什么不能用实验来证明在物体加热时物体的质量",
        "增加？"
      ]
    }
  ],
